Third-Party Data

The MIT License above applies to the software contained in this repository.

The geographic catalog data distributed in
django_sifen_catalogs/data/locations.csv is derived from official public
data published by Paraguay's Dirección Nacional de Ingresos Tributarios (DNIT),
based on geographic reference data from the Instituto Nacional de Estadística
(INE).

The original data remains subject to the applicable terms and licensing of its
respective public sources. The inclusion and transformation of this data in
this package does not transfer ownership of the original data to the author of
this software and does not imply endorsement by DNIT, INE, or the Paraguayan
Government.

For source information, attribution, catalog metadata, and details about the
transformation of the official source data, see:

django_sifen_catalogs/data/PROVENANCE.md